  "notes": [
    "Actual public-XRT dedicated live owner and borrowed Executor; 14 public APIs; no new shared runtime or private Core API. Component snapshots can lag owner turns and retain final adapter layout bytes after physical adapter release.",
    "Native Windows GCC O2; WSL GCC O2 ASan/UBSan/leak-halt modular/single/examples; final root/leaf packages plain O2 with real consumers. Separate complete WSL GCC O1 TSan unit passes with the retained atomic_thread_fence warning.",
    "Completion output is reserved before kernel Poll. Metadata has no Data pointer. Close and physical join can finish before replies/results/retirement are consumed; destruction never consumes caller Data duties.",
    "Thirteen service units include four final static/shared leaf units. Every unit includes actual clocks/folds/wall jumps, retry success/attempt/elapsed bounds, held-owner queue close, unrelated-pool and owner self-wait rejection, clock failures, physical results/cancellation, racing collectors, 512 concurrent Info requests and eight four-producer Add/Close races.",
    "All units execute 2048 warmed dispatch cycles; requested-heap zero-allocation assertions are enabled in seven memory-stats/TSan-selected units (14336 cycles), not claimed for uninstrumented package units. Observed cold creator-thread/kernel/adapter allocation prefix quotas release all live charges.",
    "Smoke is one 32-arrival UTC tick per platform: Windows observed start P99/max 13ms, owner-sample-to-worker P99 0.587ms; WSL start P99/max 0ms at millisecond quantization, owner-to-worker P99 0.808ms. Zero means below reporting resolution, not zero latency. This is not isolated native-pool queue delay, maximum throughput or P99 acceptance. No favorable timing retries.",
    "Initial Windows final-unit consumer build lacked the selected Core feature flags because its shared test harness includes Core before extension features. The validation harness now supplies the real leaf closure; source stayed unchanged and already-passed measurement/tool steps were reused. Production example/header/package consumers use the public module selection directly.",
    "Size outputs were frozen before final plain-O2 package consumers; final artifacts and source hashes are checked. All final C/H inputs stayed frozen while compilers ran.",
    "No pinned throughput/P99, native Linux, >=72h or production acceptance. Named-zone database/reload, leap-aware conversion, durable recovery, nominal DST policies and bounded recurrence CPU work remain, alongside the full MQTT/Redis/RPC scope."
  ]
